From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:06:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: master switch for automatic strap vibrations, off by
 default

StrapVibration gates WhoopBleClient.buzz(), the single funnel shared by
notification/call mirroring, inactivity and stress nudges, HR-zone coaching,
intervals, breathing, live sessions and double-tap actions. Off in the family
build; a card at the top of Automations turns it back on. Explicit one-shot
requests (buzzStrapOnce: Live "buzz now", Tasker) are not gated; the strap's
own firmware may still buzz when a link re-bonds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
